title: Skit
description: Loud. The accent is the ground, the person is big in the middle, the title is hand-written and tilted, stickers everywhere.
eyebrow: Content creation · Thumbnails
source: src/studio/youtube.css · site/pages/frames/thumb-skit.hbs
