<p>Change the words in <code>site/pages/frames/thumb-skit.hbs</code> and export with <code>npm run frames thumb-skit</code>; or rebuild it as layers with <a href="/content-creation/youtube/pixelmator/">the Pixelmator script</a>. The person is <code>demo.me</code> — the owner’s portrait in <code>assets/brand/</code> — and <code>--im-studio-focus</code> on the person says which part of the photograph to keep.</p>
